  /// INTERNAL_CURATED | FDA | NLM | RXNORM | DAILYMED | MANUFACTURER_LABEL | PEER_REVIEWED_LITERATURE | CLINICAL_GUIDELINE | PHARMACY_REFERENCE | OTHER
